TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 241943270}
  m_Text: 'CRAFTING (no recipes)


    Dip a STICK in the glue, then

    touch a STONE to it. It stays.

    One coat per stick.


    VINE: hold it against two

    glued things that touch and

    wiggle it to lash them.


    Hit the dummy to test them.'
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 0.0042
  m_LineSpacing: 1
